*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: a pressure altitude in feet with STD. "9500 FT STD" is the same as FL95, so it is above FL65.

AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR
AH 9500 FT STD
AL FL65
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
